# cFish.io WordPress Development Toolset

## Core Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [Cursor](https://cursor.sh/) | Primary code editor | AI-powered code editor where you'll do most development |
| [WordPress Studio](https://wordpress.com/studio) | Local WordPress environment | For testing and deploying to WordPress.com |
| [Git](https://git-scm.com/) | Version control | Track changes and collaborate |
| [GitHub](https://github.com/) | Code repository | Remote storage for your codebase |

## Browser Testing Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [Chrome DevTools](https://developers.google.com/web/tools/chrome-devtools) | Inspect and debug | Built into Chrome browser |
| [Responsive Design Mode](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Tools/Responsive_Design_Mode) | Test responsive layouts | Available in most browsers |
| [BrowserStack](https://www.browserstack.com/) | Cross-browser testing | Commercial service (if needed) |

## WordPress Development Plugins

| Plugin | Purpose | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| [Query Monitor](https://wordpress.org/plugins/query-monitor/) | Debug database queries | Essential for performance debugging |
| [Debug Bar](https://wordpress.org/plugins/debug-bar/) | WordPress debugging | Shows query, cache, and other info |
| [Theme Check](https://wordpress.org/plugins/theme-check/) | Theme standards validation | Ensures themes meet WP standards |

## Performance Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [GTmetrix](https://gtmetrix.com/) | Site performance analysis | Identifies optimization opportunities |
| [WebPageTest](https://www.webpagetest.org/) | Advanced performance testing | Detailed performance metrics |
| [Lighthouse](https://developers.google.com/web/tools/lighthouse) | Performance, accessibility, SEO | Built into Chrome DevTools |

## Local Development Enhancers

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [WP-CLI](https://wp-cli.org/) | Command-line interface for WP | Automate WordPress tasks |
| [Local Database Viewer](https://www.mysql.com/products/workbench/) | MySQL Workbench | Direct database manipulation |
| [Visual Studio Code Extensions](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=wordpresstoolbox.wordpress-toolbox) | WordPress Toolbox | When using VS Code instead of Cursor |

## Design & Asset Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [Figma](https://www.figma.com/) | Design and mockups | Free tier available |
| [Adobe Creative Cloud](https://www.adobe.com/creativecloud.html) | Image editing and creation | Commercial product |
| [TinyPNG](https://tinypng.com/) | Image optimization | Compress images for web |

## Documentation Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [Markdown](https://www.markdownguide.org/) | Documentation format | Used in GitHub and documentation files |
| [Docusaurus](https://docusaurus.io/) | Documentation site generator | If you need a dedicated docs site |
| [Draw.io](https://app.diagrams.net/) | Diagram creation | Free flowchart and diagram tool |

## Recommended Browser Extensions

| Extension | Purpose | Notes |
|-----------|---------|-------|
| [Web Developer](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/web-developer/bfbameneiokkgbdmiekhjnmfkcnldhhm) | Web development toolkit | Disable CSS, JS, and more |
| [Wappalyzer](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/wappalyzer/gppongmhjkpfnbhagpmjfkannfbllamg) | Identify site technologies | See what a site is built with |
| [Pesticide](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/pesticide-for-chrome/bblbgcheenepgnnajgfpiicnbbdmmooh) | CSS debugging | Outline all elements |
| [ColorZilla](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/colorzilla/bhlhnicpbhignbdhedgjhgdocnmhomnp) | Color picker | Sample colors from webpages |

## Deployment & Backup Tools

| Tool | Purpose | Notes |
|------|---------|-------|
| [WordPress.com](https://wordpress.com/) | Hosting platform | Your production environment |
| [UpdraftPlus](https://wordpress.org/plugins/updraftplus/) | Backup solution | If not using Jetpack backups |
| [GitHub Actions](https://github.com/features/actions) | CI/CD automation | For advanced automated workflows | 